<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sonoco said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sonoco said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon cuts Sonoco Products Co to hold from buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was down 3/4 at 27-5/8.</p>
</text>
